{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Comedy of Errors"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Check Out her Profile!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le10ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Wishes About the Present and The Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use \u201c<span class=\"italic\">I wish ... </span>\u201d to talk about things you do not have or do, or you cannot have or do.</br> The verb<span class=\"italic\"> wish </span>introduces an idea. After<span class=\"italic\"> wish</span>, you use a verb in the past tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I wish I knew ...</br> I wish I had ... </br>I wish you were ..."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I had fuller lips.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would like to have fuller lips, but it isn't possible.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I really wish I could dance better.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would like to be a better dancer, but that seems very unlikely.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I really wish I knew how to speak more languages.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would like to speak more languages, but I can't.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wish my ears didn't stick out so much. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " I guess I wish I had fuller lips. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm a pretty good musician, but I really wish I could dance better."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I really wish I knew how to speak more languages."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Necessity"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">must</span> and <span class=\"italic\">have (got)</span> to to express necessity in the past or in the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Must</span> refers to a necessary condition that comes from the subject and may be directed at the subject or the person the subject is talking to or about. It is used to express a strong necessity."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>Example: </br><span class=\"italic\">I must set up this online profile by tomorrow.</br>An ideal date must include good food.</span></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have (got)  to </span>expresses external obligations, which come from outside of the subject. These may be rules and regulations over which the subject has no control. It is used to express necessity in a lower degree than with <span class=\"italic\">must.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>Example: </br><span class=\"italic\">My ideal date has to be tall.</ul></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Absence of obligation is expressed with the <span class=\"strong\">negative form of have to</span>, not with mustn't."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>Example: </br><span class=\"italic\">My ideal date doesn't have to be well off.</span></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Must</span> has no past form. Instead, we use <span class=\"italic\">had to </span> to express past obligations:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>I had to finish some work, so I couldn't set up my online profile last night.</ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "He's absolutely got to have a washboard stomach."}, {"type": "example", "content": "An ideal date simply must include good food."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He has to be spontaneous."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sift"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to seperate; to look thoroughly so as to identify what you are looking for"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I sifted through the garbage looking for my ring."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le10ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you make a dating profile!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flabby"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "soft and fat"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My dad is starting to get a little flabby."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le10ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ripped"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very muscular and toned"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: The personal trainer's body is ripped."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le10ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cold-blooded"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "deliberately cruel"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our boss fires people for no reason because he is cold blooded. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le10ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pushover"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "A person who is easily persuaded"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My brother is a pushover. You can convince him to do anything."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le10ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spontaneous"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "coming from a natural impulse"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The spontaneous emotions of so many fans have  overwhelmed the internet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le10ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "high maintenance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "demands a lot of attention"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My cat is very high maintenance."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le10ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research various people that have ideal features."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a collage of the perfect face for your ideal mate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain my choices and my collage."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 200 words describing my ideal partner's personality in detail."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for  pictures of the faces of different people in a magazine or go online. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Print or cut out their best facial features and create the perfect face for a potential mate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Cut out your ideal nose, or a set eyes you feel are perfect."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In groups, explain your collage and whose features did you use and why did you pick those features."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a 200 word paper describing your ideal partner in detail."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Emphasize personality traits and characteristics and why you like those individual traits."}]}], "labs": [{"type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "title": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le10ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le10ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Ok. Now that we have signed you up, let's look at some examples of what to write.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Peter</span>: Ok\n</br></br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">\nWhat would you like to change about yourself?\n</span></br></br>\n<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span> Well, if I'm being honest, I wish my ears didn't stick out so much. And I guess I wish I had fuller lips. I'm a pretty good musician, but I really wish I could dance better. I enjoy parties and clubs, but I always feel a little bit shy when I get out on the dance floor.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Peter</span>: Really? You're an ok dancer.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: There is always room for improvement.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Peter</span>: Let's see what else.", "id": 1}, {"time": "35600", "image": "engenn10le10ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">What physical qualities should your date possess?</span>\n</br></br></span><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Well, he's absolutely got to have a washboard stomach. And he needs to be tall. I mean, it really doesn't bother me if a guy is short, but I would prefer it if he were taller than me (in heels, of course!).\n</br></br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">\nPeter</span>: Really? You have got to date Mr. abs?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Hey. I'm a busy girl, so I don't have a lot of time to spend sifting through a bunch of flabby dudes I'm not going to contact. So the guy needs to be ripped! You have to specific.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Peter</span>: Cold blooded!", "id": 2}, {"time": "69500", "image": "engenn10le10ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">What personal qualities should your date possess?\n</br></br></span>\n<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: He should be sweet, but definitely not a pushover. He doesn't need to be well off, but it would be nice if he had a job. And he has to be spontaneous, I adore spontaneity in a man!\n</br></br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">\nWhat is your ideal date?\n</br></br></span>\n<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: I really wish I knew how to speak more languages, because my ideal dates all involve travel. I would especially love to go to the culinary hotspots, like Italy, Thailand, or France. An ideal date simply must include good food, accompanied by a glass of vintage red.\n</br></br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">\nPeter</span>: Wow! You are high maintenance.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Yep, but I am worth it.", "id": 3}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le10ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le10ob02re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about relationships and use colloquial expressions."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss hopes and wishes for the present and the future."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express what is necessary."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What personality characteristics and physical attributes do you look for in a partner?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What are your best qualities you bring to a relationship?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "in